    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">PH Measurement</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Measure the length of individual culms from soil surface to the tip of the spike (do not include awn) and record to the nearest centimeter. (Average of 4-10 plants/culms per plot).</ns1:definition>
